From f615a2f426b495b2b5378f6ee252662b0baa4d79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangyingchao <yang.yingchao@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 10:51:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(screenshot): add --path to override capture output path

Mirrors the established convention of driving screenshot capture from the msg subcommand line (e.g. niri msg screenshot).

Assisted-by: opencode:deepseek-flash
---
